{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_fef_invest_design_system", "label": "FEF Invest \u2014 Design System", "file_type": "document", "rationale": "Documento de regras de interface que vence qualquer refer\u00eancia visual em caso de d\u00favida. Identidade: SaaS financeiro claro com sidebar escura teal, denso na tabela e arejado no resto, sistema flat.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_tokens_de_cor", "label": "Tokens de cor", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Paleta nomeada por fun\u00e7\u00e3o e n\u00e3o por matiz: --brand-600/700/900/100, --up/--down com seus fundos, --warn trio, superf\u00edcies e textos. Nomear por papel \u00e9 o que permite as regras de uso das se\u00e7\u00f5es seguintes.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 Cor", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_regra_teal_interativo", "label": "Teal s\u00f3 em elemento interativo", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Teal marca bot\u00e3o, link, item ativo, foco e sidebar \u2014 nunca dentro de c\u00e9lula de tabela nem em n\u00famero, para que teal permane\u00e7a sinal inequ\u00edvoco de 'isto \u00e9 clic\u00e1vel'. A \u00fanica exce\u00e7\u00e3o documentada \u00e9 s\u00e9rie de gr\u00e1fico (\u00a79), e mesmo ela cai quando o gr\u00e1fico compara alta e baixa.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 Regras de cor, regra 1", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_verde_vermelho_variacao", "label": "Verde e vermelho reservados para varia\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "--up e --down s\u00f3 significam alta e baixa; nunca s\u00e3o cor de marca nem decora\u00e7\u00e3o, para n\u00e3o gerar falso sinal financeiro.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a71 Regras de cor, regra 2", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_shell_sidebar_topbar", "label": "Shell: sidebar 240px + topbar 64px", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "A sidebar \u00e9 o \u00fanico elemento escuro do sistema e a topbar \u00e9 branca \u2014 escurecer os dois cria uma moldura em L que sufoca o conte\u00fado. Abaixo de lg (1024) a sidebar vira drawer sobreposto acionado pela topbar.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a75 Layout e navega\u00e7\u00e3o", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_tabela_coluna_travada", "label": "Tabela com coluna travada e overflow horizontal", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "position: sticky; left: 0 exige fundo opaco, hover expl\u00edcito e borda direita para a coluna n\u00e3o se misturar com o conte\u00fado que passa por baixo.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a76 Tabela", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_estados_skeleton_vazio_erro", "label": "Estados: skeleton, vazio, erro e cota\u00e7\u00e3o defasada", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Skeleton com a dimens\u00e3o exata do conte\u00fado real, sen\u00e3o a p\u00e1gina pula quando o dado chega e o usu\u00e1rio perde a linha que estava lendo. Copy do estado vazio diz o que fazer, n\u00e3o o que falta. Badge \u00e2mbar de defasagem: por linha s\u00f3 quando a exce\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 do ativo; se a cota de API estourou, um badge \u00fanico no cabe\u00e7alho.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a78 Estados", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_graficos", "label": "Regras de gr\u00e1ficos", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "S\u00e9rie principal em --brand-600 (exce\u00e7\u00e3o documentada ao teal), mas em compara\u00e7\u00e3o compras \u00d7 vendas as s\u00e9ries s\u00e3o --up/--down para que a barra teal n\u00e3o seja lida como clic\u00e1vel. M\u00e1ximo 4 s\u00e9ries; sem gradiente, \u00e1rea preenchida ou sombra.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a79 Gr\u00e1ficos", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_sistema_flat_excecoes", "label": "Sistema flat e suas duas exce\u00e7\u00f5es", "file_type": "rationale", "rationale": "Existem exatamente duas sombras permitidas, ambas funcionais: o anel de foco (acessibilidade de teclado) e o gradiente de overflow de 24px na tabela com scroll (affordance). Qualquer outra sombra ou gradiente \u00e9 viola\u00e7\u00e3o.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a710", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_checklist_revisao_de_tela", "label": "Checklist de revis\u00e3o de tela", "file_type": "concept", "rationale": "Dez itens bin\u00e1rios que tornam o design system audit\u00e1vel antes de considerar uma tela pronta \u2014 o an\u00e1logo visual do gate mec\u00e2nico do onp-spec.", "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": "\u00a711", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_fef_invest_design_system", "target": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_tokens_de_cor", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/design-system-fef-invest.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_design_system_fef_invest_regra_t